.TH geectl-remote-undelete-project 1  "geectl-remote-undelete-project 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-undelete\-project \- Restore a deleted project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the restore
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote undelete\-project\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Restore a deleted project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the restore
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to restore
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
